<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - July 28.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - July 28.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- At least 50,000 anti-personnel mines and 3,000 anti-tank mines have been deactivated in Mozambique since a mine clearance programme began in 1993.</p>
<p>- A vaccination campaign against polio which ended on Saturday is estimated to have reached about 75 percent of Mozambique's children under five years old.</p>
</text>
